The best way is to use an email client or web browser that allows you to perform a simple password reset using your own credentials and then send it back as soon as possible after performing this action.

The following are some of the most common ways for users to do so:
- Use Gmail (Gmail) to create a new account on their computer;
- Create a free Google Account at https://accounts.google.com/login;
- Send a message via SMS to someone who has not yet registered on the website;
- Email them through a secure link provided by the company they work for;
- Download any file from the site without paying anything extra;
- Check out online stores such as Amazon, eBay, etc.;
- Visit websites like Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn, Pinterest, Tumblr, Reddit, etc., all hosted on servers where no one else knows about them.
